# Architecture Diagram (text source)

> P6-C-02. The repo ships an ASCII architecture diagram in this file
> and a generated PNG at `docs/architecture.png`. The PNG is generated
> by `scripts/render_architecture.py` using matplotlib (no browser
> required); both forms live in the repo so judges who cannot view
> PNGs in their terminal still get the picture.

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Next.js UI (web/)                                          │
│  Chat │ Live Graph Canvas │ Path Panel │ Memory │ Timeline   │
└───────────────▲──────────────────────────┬──────────────────┘
                │ WebSocket (events)       │ REST (tenants, health)
┌───────────────┴──────────────────────────▼──────────────────┐
│  FastAPI  (api/) — rate limit, read-only demo mode          │
│  └─ Orchestrator Agent (Claude tool-use)                    │
│       ├─ Analyst Agent    (graph reasoning, read-only)     │
│       ├─ Ingestion Agent  (LLM structured extraction)      │
│       └─ Action Agent     (drains Handoff / Task nodes)     │
└───────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                │ tool calls (in-process or via MCP)
┌───────────────▼─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Tool Registry  (tools/registry.py)                         │
│  graph tools │ memory tools │ action tools │ coordination   │
│        ▲▲▲                                                   │
│        └└└ also exposed by MCP Server (mcp_server/)         │
└───────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                │ Cypher + vector queries + graph algorithms
┌───────────────▼─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Memory layer (memory/)                                     │
│   semantic.py  — Fact + SUPERSEDES                          │
│   episodic.py  — Episode + TOUCHED                          │
│   procedural.py — Procedure (success_count)                 │
│   coordination.py — Agent + Task + Handoff                  │
└───────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                │ MERGE / MATCH / vector query
┌───────────────▼─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Graph layer (graph/)                                       │
│   client.py    — get_graph(tenant), shared pool            │
│   queries.py   — every Cypher (parameterised, named)        │
│   embeddings.py — sentence-transformers (384-d, cached)     │
└───────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                │
┌───────────────▼─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  FalkorDB: one graph per tenant                             │
│   org_acme   = company knowledge + agent memory + tasks     │
│   org_globex = isolated second tenant                       │
│   (vectors, indexes, PageRank, shortest path all in-DB)     │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## Generating the PNG

```bash
pip install matplotlib
python scripts/render_architecture.py
# writes docs/architecture.png
```

The script writes the same diagram with boxes drawn by matplotlib so
the PNG is suitable for the README and the slide deck.